      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The original log cabin where Jackson and his wife lived from 1804 to 1821 is part of the First Hermitage complex.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Hermitage_(Nashville%2C_Tennessee)",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "At its peak, the Hermitage enslaved 110 people who worked as cooks, blacksmiths, musicians, and more.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
